colors\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex justify-between h-16\"><div class=\"flex items-center\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"rounded rotate-180\" style=\"color:transparent;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 2px white)\" src=\"/floppy-disk.svg\"/>Casey J Davis</a></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center space-x-8\"><a class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-white transition\" href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-white transition\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-white transition\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><button class=\"p-2 rounded-lg bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5\"></div></button></div><div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center gap-3\"><button class=\"p-2 rounded-lg bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5\"></div></button><button class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-white\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></nav><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-50 to-white dark:from-gray-900 dark:to-gray-950\"><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-20 pb-16\"><div class=\"text-center\"><img alt=\"Casey J Davis\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"rounded-full mx-auto mb-8\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fcaseyjdavis.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fcaseyjdavis.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fcaseyjdavis.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75\"/><h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6\">👋 Hi, I&#x27;m Casey an IT Consultant</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">I help businesses navigate complex technical challenges and drive digital transformation. Located in Edgewater, Colorado.</p><div class=\"flex gap-4 justify-center flex-col sm:flex-row\"><a class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition\" href=\"/contact\">Get in Touch</a><a class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold border-2 border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 hover:border-gray-400 dark:hover:border-gray-600 transition\" href=\"/blog\">Read My Blog</a></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-12\">Services</h2><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-4\">💡</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3 dark:text-white\">Strategic Consulting</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">Expert guidance on technology strategy, architecture decisions, and digital transformation initiatives.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-4\">⚙️</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3 dark:text-white\">Technical Implementation</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">Hands-on development and implementation of scalable, modern solutions tailored to your business needs.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-4\">📈</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3 dark:text-white\">Performance Optimization</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">Analyze and optimize your existing systems for better performance, scalability, and cost efficiency.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 py-16\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-12\">Recent Work</h2><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 96 96\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"#0078D4\" d=\"M0 0h48v48H0z\"></path><path fill=\"#50E6FF\" d=\"M48 0h48v48H48z\"></path><path fill=\"#0078D4\" d=\"M0 48h48v48H0z\"></path><path fill=\"#00BCF2\" d=\"M48 48h48v48H48z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold dark:text-white\">Microsoft Entra Tenant Migration</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4\">Migrated an existing organization&#x27;s Office 365 tenant with zero downtime, streamlined device deployment using Microsoft Autopilot and automated user account creation.</p><div class=\"flex gap-2 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded\">Entra</span><span class=\"bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded\">Powershell</span><span class=\"bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded\">Azure</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h8l-1 8 10-12h-8l1-8z\" fill=\"#FFC107\" stroke=\"#F57C00\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold dark:text-white\">Web Analytics and SEO Optimization</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4\">Helping small busineses understand their web traffic and market to new customers once their SEO is optimized.</p><div class=\"flex gap-2 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded\">GA4</span><span class=\"bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded\">Github</span><span class=\"bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded\">Posthog</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16\"><div class=\"bg-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-700 rounded-2xl p-12 text-center text-white\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">Ready to level up your IT?</h2><p class=\"text-xl mb-8 opacity-90\">Let&#x27;s discuss how I can help your business succeed</p><a class=\"inline-block bg-white text-blue-600 px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition\" href=\"/contact\">Schedule a Free Consult</a></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-bd597b7d8bd998a8.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[6174,[\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"356\\\",\\\"static/chunks/356-5cad24532f4c0e5d.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-681c48940789fb88.js\\\"],\\\"ThemeProvider\\\"]\\n3:I[2910,[\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"356\\\",\\\"static/chunks/356-5cad24532f4c0e5d.js\\\",\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-681c48940789fb88.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[1356,[\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"356\\\",\\\"static/chunks/356-5cad24532f4c0e5d.js\\\",\\\"974\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/page-b17c01e0cb3c90ae.js\\\"],\\\"Image\\\"]\\n7:I[2619,[\\\"619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\\\",\\\"356